---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import TimeLineElement from "../components/cv/TimeLine.astro";
---

<BaseLayout title="Resume" sideBarActiveItemID="cv">
  <div class="mb-5">
    <div class="text-3xl w-full font-bold">Summary</div>
  </div>

  <div class="mb-10 text-justify">
    Machine Learning Engineer and applied researcher with 10 papers, 8 as first author (7 accepted or published, 3 under
    review) in speech, computer vision and efficient ML. Takes models from research to production: runs self-hosted LLM
    serving on in-house GPUs, builds speech systems (TTS, ASR, end-of-turn detection) for low-resource languages, and
    designs lightweight models for real-time and resource-constrained deployment.
  </div>

  <div class="mb-5">
    <div class="text-3xl w-full font-bold">Education</div>
  </div>

  <div class="time-line-container grid gap-4 mb-10">
    <TimeLineElement
      title="B.Sc in Software Engineering, Department of CSE"
      subtitle="June 2021 to September 2025 at <span class='font-bold text-red-900 dark:text-red-600'>Islamic University of Technology</span> - CGPA: 3.80/4.00"
    >
      <ul class="list-disc ml-4">
        <li><strong>Thesis:</strong> Squeeze-Aware-YOLO: Early Channel Recalibration and Multi-Scale Fusion for Real-Time Traffic Sign Detection <em>(accepted at DICTA 2026)</em></li>
        <li><strong>English Proficiency:</strong> IELTS Academic, Overall Band 8.0</li>
      </ul>
    </TimeLineElement>
  </div>

  <div class="mb-5">
    <div class="text-3xl w-full font-bold">Work Experience</div>
  </div>

  <div class="time-line-container mb-10">
    <TimeLineElement
      title="Machine Learning Engineer"
      subtitle="October 2025 to Present at <span class='font-bold text-red-900 dark:text-red-600'>Vivasoft Limited</span>, Banani, Dhaka"
    >
      <ul class="list-disc ml-4">
        <li>Set up and maintain production-grade serving of self-hosted Gemma 4 models on in-house GPU servers using vLLM and SGLang, replacing external LLM API calls with local LLMs.</li>
        <li>Built a reverse-proxy gateway in front of the self-hosted LLMs that inspects request content, validates API keys, enforces rate limits, rotates TLS certificates automatically, and routes each request to the right model; monitored it with Prometheus and Grafana.</li>
        <li>Applied graph community detection to select community-aware core-sets for data-efficient TTS training (Structure Before Sampling, accepted at ALTA 2026).</li>
        <li>Built and trained a custom Bangla TTS model on an in-house curated dataset (BanglaKontho, O-COCOSDA 2026).</li>
        <li>Developed a Bangla end-of-turn detection model for a real-time voice chatbot (BanglaTurn, O-COCOSDA 2026).</li>
        <li>Trained multiple Automatic Speech Recognition (ASR) models, including Whisper and NVIDIA NeMo, for the Nepali language.</li>
        <li>Built domain-specific Small Language Models (SLMs) optimized for fast CPU inference.</li>
        <li>Designed and implemented an efficient end-to-end Speech-to-Speech system for low-latency voice interactions.</li>
        <li>Designed and implemented an end-to-end ML data pipeline on GCP for data ingestion, preprocessing, and training ML models.</li>
      </ul>
    </TimeLineElement>
    <TimeLineElement
      title="Associate Software Engineer"
      subtitle="June 2024 to September 2024 at <span class='font-bold text-red-900 dark:text-red-600'>Vivasoft Limited</span>, Banani, Dhaka"
    >
      <ul class="list-disc ml-4">
        <li>Replaced a GPT-4o-based AI image search module with a self-hosted Vision Transformer model for an Indonesian e-commerce platform.</li>
        <li>Built a retrieval-augmented Shopify chatbot for product recommendation using GPT-3.5, LangChain, FastAPI and Pinecone Vector DB.</li>
      </ul>
    </TimeLineElement>
    <TimeLineElement
      title="Software Developer Intern"
      subtitle="April 2024 to May 2024 at <span class='font-bold text-red-900 dark:text-red-600'>Itransition Group</span>, Remote"
    >
      <ul class="list-disc ml-4">
        <li>Developed and deployed five Ruby on Rails applications with secure authentication and responsive Bootstrap interfaces.</li>
      </ul>
    </TimeLineElement>
    <TimeLineElement
      title="Software Developer Intern"
      subtitle="June 2023 to August 2023 at <span class='font-bold text-red-900 dark:text-red-600'>OpenGenus Foundation</span>, Remote"
    >
      <ul class="list-disc ml-4">
        <li>Authored and published 10+ technical articles on web development, data structures, algorithms, and core UX principles. (<a href="https://iq.opengenus.org/author/mizbaul/" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Link</a>)</li>
        <li>Developed a virtual keyboard with HTML, CSS and JavaScript, complete with comprehensive documentation and open-source source code. (<a href="https://github.com/OpenGenus/Virtual-keyboard" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Link</a>)</li>
      </ul>
    </TimeLineElement>
  </div>

  <div class="mb-5">
    <div class="text-3xl w-full font-bold">Research Experience</div>
  </div>

  <div class="time-line-container mb-10">
    <TimeLineElement
      title="Research Intern"
      subtitle="March 2025 to Present at <span class='font-bold text-red-900 dark:text-red-600'>Advanced Machine Intelligence Research Lab</span>, Remote"
    >
      <ul class="list-disc ml-4">
        <li>Implemented federated learning and applied model pruning and quantization to improve efficiency and privacy in distributed training (PruneFedAD, DASA'25).</li>
        <li>Developed a lightweight classification model using depthwise convolutional networks, maintaining high accuracy for complex classification tasks.</li>
        <li>Enhanced skin cancer classification performance using ensemble techniques.</li>
      </ul>
    </TimeLineElement>
  </div>

