      <em>ACM CHI Conference on Human Factors in Computing Systems (CHI 2027). &ndash; First author</em>
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>Not Hearing or Not Negating? Disentangling Negation Failures of Audio-Language Models in English and Bangla</strong><br/>
      <em>ACL Rolling Review (ARR), October 2026 cycle; to be committed to NAACL 2027. &ndash; First author</em>
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>LeafLiteNet: A Computationally Frugal Interpretable Neural Architecture Under Controlled and Uncontrolled Environmental Conditions</strong><br/>
