  </div>

  <ul class="list-disc mx-6 mb-10 grid gap-2">
    <li>2nd Runner Up: Streamstech presents IUT ICT Fest 2024 Code Catalyst: Refactoring Contest</li>
    <li>Finalist at AI and API Hackathon, United Group presents BUET CSE Fest 2024.</li>
    <li>Awarded AWS AI & ML Scholarship out of thousands of applicants across the world.</li>
    <li>Winner at ML Olympiad: Tensorflow User Group Bangladesh by Google.</li>
    <li>Placed one of top 5 teams in CodeRush 1.0 Hackathon.</li>
    <li>Secured a place in top 50 of the Huawei Seeds For The Future 2024, Bangladesh.</li>
  </ul>

  <div class="mb-5">
    <div class="text-3xl w-full font-bold">Extracurricular Activities</div>
  </div>

  <div class="mb-8">
    <div class="text-xl font-semibold mb-2">Microsoft Learn Student Ambassadors</div>
    <ul class="list-disc mx-6 grid gap-2">
      <li>Hosted and organized educational workshops focused on web development and delivered engaging presentations particularly on HTML, CSS, JavaScript, Git, GitHub, Django, Azure, and Python.</li>
    </ul>
  </div>

  <div class="mb-10">
